    "text": "By Carl Hessler Jr. chessler@pottsmerc.com ,\n8 hours ago NORRISTOWN — A judge on Wednesday declared a mistrial and dismissed a jury at the trial of a Schuylkill County man accused of fatally beating his cellmate at the state prison in Skippack Township after additional information regarding certain evidence from the county coroner’s office only came to light after the trial began. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
